                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game had a lot of the same issues as the first Lost Heir game. It is clear the creator learns from these mistakes in future games, but this game still has too many unimportant stats and relies too much on maximizing single stats, causing you to fail a lot of skill checks.\r\n\r\nThe army mechanics are interesting, and the story progresses well, but it's still not a very engaging game.",
